{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"93576","name":"Appart'City Classic Lyon Part Dieu Villette","description":"The Appart'City Lyon Part Dieu Villette aparthotel is located in the heart of the Part-Dieu business district, just a few minutes on foot from Lyon Part-Dieu station. It offers comfortable private accommodation with a lift, private car park and free Wi-Fi. Reception is open 24/7. Every one of our 142 apartments is furnished and has a study area, LCD screen and kitchen equipped with a microwave, grill, kettle or cafetière and fridge. Food lovers will be delighted by the breakfast buffet, which is filled with a huge variety of items: fresh fruit, pastries, hot meals, etc. Thanks to its location in the heart of the business district, our aparthotel is ideal for business trips. History and culture fanatics can explore the city centre, located just a few minutes away, and admire the views from Basilica of Notre Dame de Fourvière. Those looking for sophisticated cuisine can ask for advice from our team, who will be delighted to recommend the best bouchon restaurants in the capital of French gastronomy.","address":"Avenue Lacassagne, 6","city":"LYON","countryCode":"FR","postalCode":"69003","lat":45.75663,"lng":4.86304,"stars":2,"chain":"APPAR","giataCode":"100979","phone":"33437919921","email":"lyon-lapartdieu@appartcity.com","website":"http://www.appartcity.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/09/093576/093576a_hb_a_013.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/09/093576/093576a_hb_a_015.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/09/093576/093576a_hb_l_003_20250520_134606.jpg","category":"lobby","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/09/093576/093576a_hb_l_004_20250520_134612.jpg","category":"lobby","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/09/093576/093576a_hb_l_005_20250520_134623.jpg","category":